Does not `$options['value']` mean as overwritten value of model attribute value?
This behaviour we can see in:<br>
`BaseHtml.php -> public static function activeTextarea`<br>
```
        if (isset($options['value'])) {
            $value = $options['value'];
            unset($options['value']);
        } else {
            $value = static::getAttributeValue($model, $attribute);
        }
```
and another methods of this Class.
May will be better use for default value another attribute, and save possibility set custom value of the field?
